# AGENTS

This workspace belongs to the OpenClaw `prod/mac` gateway.

## Defaults

- Model gateway: LiteLLM on `http://127.0.0.1:4000/v1`
- Primary coding model: `litellm/coding_primary`
- Fallbacks: `litellm/balanced_chat`, `litellm/fast_chat`

## Memory

- Durable notes go to `MEMORY.md`
- Operational scratch notes go to `memory/`
